. *****************************************************************************
> ***
. * Protest FE sweep with cohort-specific relative-year fixed effects.
. *
. * Input: stacked_data_protest5km.csv
. * Controls: never treated only.
. * Sample: rural; through August 2022; relative years -8,...,1.
. * Both event-study and DiD loops use the same loaded, prepared, restricted da
> ta.
. *****************************************************************************
> ***
. version 17

. clear all

. set more off

. set processors 5
    The maximum number of processors or cores being used is changed from 16
    to 5.  It can be set to any number between 1 and 16

. 
. args fe_arg

. local fe_env : environment PROTEST_CTIME_FE_LIST

. local sample_env : environment ANALYSIS_SAMPLE_SUFFIX

. 
. * Standalone defaults for the five standard sbatch parameters.
. global location     "shell"

